Conflicts: sectorrec-cardputer
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pil, python3-tk, sleuthkit, testdisk, gddrescue, smartmontools, udisks2, pkexec, fonts-dejavu-core
Description: guided desktop file recovery and disk imaging interface
 SectorRec provides a desktop interface to Sleuth Kit, TestDisk, PhotoRec
 and GNU ddrescue. It supports disk images and physical storage devices.
 The recovery engines are installed as distribution packages, and Polkit
 authorizes a session-scoped privileged helper only when required.

Package: sectorrec-cardputer
Architecture: arm64
Conflicts: sectorrec
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pil, sleuthkit, testdisk, smartmontools, udisks2, pkexec, fonts-dejavu-core
Description: guided file recovery for the Cardputer Zero
 Lightweight framebuffer edition of SectorRec for the Cardputer Zero.
 Uses the system's Sleuth Kit and TestDisk utilities with strictly scoped
 root-owned helper programs via Polkit, without a root interface.
